<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>You have been invited</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f9; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; }
    .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    .header { background-color: #1a56db; padding: 28px 32px; text-align: center; }
    .header-title { color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 4px; }
    .header-subtitle { color: #bfdbfe; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }
    .body { padding: 32px; color: #333333; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .body h2 { font-size: 20px; color: #1a56db; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .info-box { background: #eff6ff; border-left: 4px solid #1a56db; border-radius: 4px; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    .info-box p { margin: 4px 0; }
    .info-box strong { color: #1e40af; }
    .cta { text-align: center; margin: 28px 0; }
    .cta a { background-color: #1a56db; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 13px 32px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; }
    .note { font-size: 13px; color: #777777; margin-top: 24px; background: #fff8e1; border-radius: 4px; padding: 12px 16px; }
    .footer { background: #f4f6f9; text-align: center; padding: 18px 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #999999; }
    .divider { border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; margin: 24px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="header-title">XVI Finance Commission — CityFinance Portal</div>
      <div class="header-subtitle">Ministry of Housing and Urban Affairs</div>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
      <h2>You have been invited to join the MoHUA team</h2>
      <p>Hello <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
      <p>
        <strong>{{invitedBy}}</strong> has added you as a team member on the
        XVI Finance Commission portal (MoHUA workspace).
      </p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <p><strong>Name:</strong> {{name}}</p>
        <p><strong>Mobile:</strong> {{mobile}}</p>
        <p><strong>Role:</strong> {{role}}</p>
        <p><strong>Team:</strong> Ministry of Housing and Urban Affairs (MoHUA)</p>
      </div>

      <p>
        Please set your password to access the CityFinance Portal. Click the button below to set
        your password and complete your account setup. Your registered email address will be your
        login ID going forward.
      </p>
      <div class="info-box" style="background:#fff3cd;border-left-color:#f0ad4e;">
        <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#856404;"><strong>Login Email:</strong> {{email}}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cta">
        <a href="{{resetPasswordUrl}}" target="_blank">Set Password</a>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:#777777;text-align:center;margin-top:-16px;">
        Once your password is set, log in at <a href="{{loginUrl}}">{{loginUrl}}</a>.
      </p>

      <hr class="divider" />

      <div class="note">
        <strong>Note:</strong> If you did not expect this invitation or believe it was sent in error,
        please ignore this email or contact the MoHUA administrator.
        Do not share this link with anyone.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      &copy; CityFinance &mdash; Ministry of Housing and Urban Affairs, Government of India<br />
      This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
